ard rumors of the Magic Mirror than his burning curiosity overtook him, propelling him into a new grand adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123540/extras/cbd2cf156e3e1f3278fb10a2254fa03d.avif?t=1774403496\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying Robot Soldier</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VALNUS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Russia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 months old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Attack: Rocket Punch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb: VALNUS Buster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first flying autonomous weapon developed by Imperial Russian military forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ultimate robot centers on a rocket propulsion system, equipped with various weapons and a spring-wound thought circuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It reportedly ceases thinking unless its spring is wound every six hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It always operates under military command; this time, the Emperor personally ordered its retrieval of the magic mirror. However, it seems a semblance of “self-awareness” has recently begun sprouting within its thought circuit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123540/extras/fdd93a337ba1f08be8b4dad3babec1fd.avif?t=1774403496\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Master Carpenter of Love and Guts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetsu, Japanese, 60 years old</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Attack: Dragon Rocket Barrage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bomb: Great Edo Fire　</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary master carpenter who lost his lover in an accident in his youth and has remained unmarried for 40 years since.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He traveled to France for work several years ago and subsequently embarked on a journey through Europe. Hearing rumors of the Magic Mirror while traveling, he resolved to undertake one final adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possessing a physique of astonishing strength unmatched by his age, he uses a man-powered helicopter he built himself for this adventure. His limitless muscle power allows him to fly, defying aerodynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123540/extras/41faa490953c69123ad28ee9ab819759.avif?t=1774403496\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p>",
